    </p>

    <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center">
      <a class="bg-indigo text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm" href="tel:+16149840351">Call</a>
      <a class="bg-green text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm" href="https://wa.me/16149840351" target="_blank">WhatsApp</a>
